<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">VaGaratiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaGaratiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">VaGaratiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">VaG</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaGaratiya</para>
  <para style="mt1">VAGARATIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku ravaGaratiya ridonyohwa nonhumwa Phauro (VaGaratiya 1:1). Itsamba ridonyohwa naPhauro kumakherekhe yovaGaratiya pakati pomakore (48-57) makumi manai nomasere kusvika makumi mashano nomanomwe mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. VaGaratiya vanogona kunge vanga vari vanhu vaigara mudunhu roRoma muGaratiya. Nyanzvi dzodzidzo hadzinai chokwadi chokuti Phauro wanga ari poi paadonyora tsamba rakareri, asi maguta mairi roEfeso noroKorinde ndiyo yanogona kunge yari iyo kwaadonyora ari.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phauro adonyora achinyaira nomaKhirisitu vochiJudha novasiri maJudha, mumakherekhe yomuGaratiya. Adonyora achinyanya kuda kupikisa dzidziso yomabhwodo inoti maKhirisitu vanofanira kutevera mitemo yochiJudha kubva kuChibvumirano Chokare, kunyanyitsa wokuchecheudziwa. Panga panochikwata chovanhu pakati pomaKhirisitu vaipinza vanhu voyamwe marudzi muchiJudha vaida kuti maKhirisitu vasiri maJudha vachecheudziwe. Vaiitawo mubvunzo pamusoro pokuva nhumwa kwaPhauro. Phauro adodzivirira kuva kwache nhumwa kuburikidza nokunyaira dzimwe dzonyaya dzache (vaGaratiya 1:11—2:14) pakamu adodzivirira vhangeri nokutsanangura kuti ruponiso runokwanisika chete nokutenda muna Jesu Khirisitu (vaGaratiya 2:16). Rinouya nokunaka kunonangidziwa naMwari aikona zvinoitiwa novanhu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga tsamba rache nokumoresa makherekhe yari muGaratiya (vaGaratiya 1:1-5).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ipopo Phauro anotsanangura zvimwe zvokumasure kwache kudzivirira kodzero yache pakudzidzisa achinangidza kuti adoedza kurarama nomutemo asi hazvinai kushanda (vaGaratiya 1:6—2:21).</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera anoingidzira kutsanangura basa romutemo noromutsa panyaya yoruponiso (vaGaratiya 3:1-4).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ipopo anopasa kuraira kwomararamiro yochiKhirisitu yadonaka (vaGaratiya 5:1—6:10).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anogumisa tsamba rache nokumoresa nokukumbira kuti vayeuke kuti kusanduhwa naMwari uchiva munhu mutsva kudokosha kukunda mitemo yokunze, idoita sekuchecheudziwa (vaGaratiya 6:11-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Phauro Nhumwa, isinai kubva kuvanhu kana kuburikidza nomunhu, asi kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu naMwari Baba, vadomumutsa kuvadopfa, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />nohama dzese dzandinadzo kukherekhe dzokuno kuGaratiya,<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Mutsa norugare zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba naIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Nokuda kuti atisunungure kubva kuvanhu vazvino vadoipa, iye adozvipereka nokuda kwozvitema zvedu, zviri maererano nokuda kwaMwari naBaba wedu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Kwaari mbakuve nokubhwinya nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vhangeri Ribodzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ndinoshamisiwa kuti munokurumidza kusiya iye adokudaidzai mumutsa waKirisitu muchipindukira kurimwe vhangeri, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />kusiri kuti kuno “rimwe vhangeri,” asi kuti panovamwe vanokuvhiringidzai vachida kuedza kusandutsa vhangeri raKhirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Asi kana isisu, kana ngirozi inobva kudenga ikakuparidzirai rimwe vhangeri rinopesana noratidokuparidzirai, mbaive idoshurikidziwa! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Sekunyaira kwatidoita kare, kana ipopa ndinonyaira kamu: kana panoumwe ari kukuparidzirai vhangeri rinopesana noiro ramudotambira, mbaave adorengerehwa!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Anga ipopa ndiri kutsvaga kutambirika novanhu chere, kana naMwari? Kana pamwe ndiri kuedza kufadza vanhu? Dai ndichiri kuedza kufadza vanhu, ndaivaba muranda waKirisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzira Phauro Yaadova Nayo Nhumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Hama dzangu ndinoda kuti muzive, kuti vhangeri randidoparidza harinai kubva kumunhu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ndava handinai kuritambira kubva kumunhu, kana kuridzidzisiwa, asi ridouya kuburikidza nokuzururihwa kudobva kuna Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ndava mudonzva muraramiro wangu wokare muchiJudha, kutambudza kudokungudza kwandaiita kherekhe yaMwari ndichiedza kuiparadza. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Uye muchiJudha ndanga ndidopindiridzitsa kukunda vozera rangu pakati povanhu vangu, zvokuti ndaiva noshungu dzidonyanyitsa patsika dzomadzibaba yangu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Asi iye Mwari adondikamura ndisati ndazvahwa nokundidaidza mumutsa wache adofara <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />kuti andiisire pachenu Mwanakomana wache, kuitira kuti ndimuparidze pakati povasiri vaJudha, handinai kutsvaga nzeru kubva kumunhu upi zvache, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />kana kuenda kuJerusarema kuno avo vadondithangira kuva nhumwa, asi ndidoenda kuArabhiya, pasure ndidodzokera kuDhamasiko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Kwapera makore matatu ndipo pandidoenda kuJerusarema kobvakachira Kefasi kuti ndimuzive, ndokugara naye mazuva gumi nomashano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Asi handinai kuona imwe nhumwa kusiya kwaJakobho munin'ina waIshe.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Ndiri kukunyorerai chokwadi pamberi paMwari, hayasi mabhwodo!<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Pasure ndidoenda kumatunhu yoSiriya noSirisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Uye ndanga ndisinati ndazikana chiso nokherekhe dzaKhirisitu dzomuJudhiya, <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />vaindonzva zvichinzi, “Munhu waimbotitambudza uye, iyezvino wava kuparidza kutenda kwaaiedza kuparadza.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Vadobva vakudza Mwari nokuda kwangu.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Phauro noDzimwe Nhumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Zvino pasure pomakore gumi nomanai ndidoenda kamu kuJerusarema ndina Bhanabhasi, naTito ndidomutorawo tichienda pabodzi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ndidoenda ndaita kuzururihwa, ndokusangana muchihwande naivo vainzi vatungamiri ndichivatsanangurira vhangeri randinoparidza pakati povasiri vaJudha. Ndichiitira kuti ndive nochokwadi kuti kutizira kwandidoita nokwandichiri kuita kureke kuva kwomahara. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Asi Tito, wandanga ndinaye kana zvache ari muGiriki, haanai kusukumidziwa kuti achecheudziwe, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />asi nyaya yakarei idomuka nondava yokuti vamwe vaiva hama dzomabhwodo vadoverevedza kuti vaongorore kusununguka kwatinako muna Khirisitu Jesu. Vachida kutiita varanda, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Nokuda kukuchengeterai chokwadi chovhangeri, hatinai kubvuma kana nopadiki pese.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Kana vari avo vaiita sevatungamiri—ndinodaro ndava zvavanga vari hazvinai musiyano kwandiri, Mwari haatonge nokuona zviri kunze—vanhu vakarevo havanai chavadoingidzira panozvandinoparidza. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Panokuti zvidaro, vadotoona kuti ndidovimbiwa naMwari pabasa rokuparidza vhangeri kunovasiri vaJudha, kunge kuvimbiwa kudoitiwa Pita kuvaJudha. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Ndava iye Mwari waishanda muunhumwa hwaPita senhumwa yovaJudha, ndiye waishanda mandiriwo senhumwa kunovasiri vaJudha. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Saka Jakobho, Kefasi naJohwani, avo vaitorewa sembiru, pavadoona mutsa udopasiwa kwandiri, vadonditambira inini naBhanabhasi nomwoyo wese kuti tiyanane navo paushumiri. Tidobvumirana kuti isisu tiende kunovasiri vaJudha ivo vachienda kuvaJudha. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Vadotikumbira kuti tirambe tichiyeuka varombo basi, chiriwo chinhu chandagara ndichiditsa kuita.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro anoDzuma Kefasi paAndiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Asi Kefasi paadouya kuAndiyoki, ndidomupikisa pachena, ndava waidzonga. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Ndava varume vadobva kuna Jakobho vasinati vauya, waija novatendi vasiri vaJudha. Asi pavadouya, adothanga kusuduruka achizvikamura kubva kwavari, achicha vaJudha vokuchecheudziwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Vamwe vatendi vochiJudha vadobatanawo naye paunyengeri hwache, zvokuti naBhanabhasi adotsambutsiwawo nounyengeri hwavo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Asi pandidoona kuti havasi kutekaira pamutsetse unoenderana nochokwadi chovhangeri, ndidoti kuna Kefasi pamberi pavo vese, “Iwepa uri muJudha, asi wanga uchirarama kunge usiri muJudha aikona semuJudha. Ko zvino sei uri kusukumidza vasiri vaJudha kutevera tsika dzovaJudha?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vese Vanoponesewa noKutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Isisu vaJudha pakuzvahwa, tisiri pautadzi hwokusava vaJudha, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />tinoziva kuti munhu haaruramisiwe nomabasa yomutemo asi kuburikidza nokutenda muna Khirisitu Jesu, kuitira kuti naisisuwo tiruramisiwe nokutenda muna Khirisitu, aikona nomabasa yomutemo. Ndava hapanai acharuramisiwa nomabasa yomutemo. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Zvino kana tichitsvaga kururamisiwa muna Khirisitu, isisu vaJudha toonewa tiri pakati povatadzi, hazvinangidze chere kuti Khirisitu anokurudzira chitadzo? Neye, zvakarezvo ndizvoba! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Kana ndathanga kuvaka kamu chimiso chomutemo chandidombopaza, zvava kuoneka kuti ndiri kuchorawo mutemo. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ndava kana uri mutemo, ndidopfa kwauri, kuitira kuti ndiraramire Mwari. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Ndidoroverehwa kubodzi naKhirisitu, ndiniba ndichiri kurarama, asi Khirisitu anorarama mandiri. Upenyu hwandinorarama izvozvi mumuviri ndinohurarama nokutenda muMwanakomana waMwari, adondida ndokuzvipereka nokuda kwangu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Handitadzise mutsa waMwari, ndava kana kururama kuchiwanika kuburikidza nomutemo, Khirisitu adopfira mahara!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Mutemo kana Kutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Naimi vaGaratiya madzemwa! Mbani adokurowai? Jesu Khirisitu wamudonangidziwa mumeso yenyu chaimo seadorovehwa pamuchinjikwa! <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ndinyepei, mudotambira Mweya kuburikidza nomabasa yomutemo chere, kana nokutenda zvamudonzva? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Mudodzemwaira zvidodai nai? Mudothanga noMweya, apa maakupedzisa nomiviri? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Anga kutambudzika kweseku mudokuitira mahara chere? Ndokunge yanga yari mahara! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ko Mwari paanokupasai Mweya wache nokuita minana pakati penyu anozviita nomabasa yomutemo chere, kana nokutenda zvamudonzva?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Fungai zvaAbhurahamu, “Adotenda Mwari, kwaari zvikaverengewa kuti ndiko kururama kwache.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Saka munoona kuti vanhu vokutenda ndivo vana vaAbhurahamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Uye gwaro, nokuona zviri kumberi kuti Mwari acharuramisa vasiri vaJudha nokutenda, ridogara raparidza vhangeri kuna Abhurahamu, richiti, “Mauri marudzi yese yacharopafadziwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Saka, vanhu vokutenda vanoropafadziwa pabodzi naAbhurahamu wanga ano kutenda.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ndava vese vanotsamira pamabasa yomutemo vari pakushurikidziwa, sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa kuti, “Adoshurikidziwa wese asingarambe achiita nokutetekera zvese zvidonyohwa mubhuku romutemo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Saka zviri pachenu kuti pamberi paMwari, hapanai munhu anoruramisiwa nomutemo. Ndava “Uyo adorurama achararama nokutenda.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Asi mutemo haunei nokutenda, ndava gwaro rinoti, “Uyo anoita zvese zvinodiwa nomutemo achararamisiwa nazvo.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Khirisitu adotisunungura kubva pakushurikidza kwomutemo, nokutora nzvimbo yedu kwaadoita achiva chidoshurikidziwa ndava kudonyohwa kuti, “Wese anoturikiwa pamuti, adoshurikidziwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Khirisitu Jesu adoita zvakarezvi kuti ropafadzo ridovimbisiwa Abhurahamu rigone kuva rovasiri vaJudha, kuti kuburikidza nokutenda isisu tigone kutambira chivimbiso choMweya.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutemo noChivimbiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Hama dzangu, regai ndipereke muenzaniso, sezvo pasinai anokwanisa kutadzisa kana kuingidzira chitsidzo chinenge chidoitiwa nomunhu chichibva chasimbisiwa, naipopa ndomwaigerire kamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Zvino Mwari adoita zvivimbiso kuna Abhurahamu nokumwana wache. Gwaro hariti, “Nokuvana,” kureva vadowanda, asi, kumubodzi, “nokumwana wako,” anova Khirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Zvandirikureva nzvokuti, mutemo, udodzouya mumasure momakore mazana manai yano makore makumi matatu, haungapfudze chibvumirano chagara chidomisiwa naMwari, kuti ushaise simba chivimbiso. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ndava kana nhaka iri yomutemo, haichava yochivimbiso, manje Mwari adoipasa kuna Abhurahamu kuburikidza nochivimbiso.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Zvino mutemo udopasiwa nondava yei? Udodzoingidzihwa nondava yozvitadzo, kusvikira mwana wanga adonangiwa nochivimbiso wauya. Mutemo udopasiwa nongirozi kuvanhu vanga vari vamiririri. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Kuti vamiririri zvinoreva vadowanda, manje Mwari mubodzi.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinangwa choMutemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Anga zvino iwo mutemo unohwisa zvivimbiso zvaMwari nai? Nenene ndizvoba! Ndava kana mutemo udotambihwa waikwanisa kupasa upenyu, kureva kuti pachokwadi kururamisiwa kwaikwanisawo kuuya nomutemo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Asi gwaro rinoti nyika yese iri pasi posimba rochitadzo, kuti chipo chidovimbisiwa kuburikidza nokutenda muna Jesu Khirisitu chipasiwe vanotenda.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Asi kutenda kusinati kwauya, tanga tidozaririhwa pasi pomutemo, tiri pausungwa kusvikira kutenda kwaidzouya kwanangidziwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Nokudaro mutemo wanga uri muchengetedzi wedu kusvikira pakuuya kwaKhirisitu, kuti tiruramisiwe nokutenda. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Asi zvino nokuti kutenda kudouya, hatisisiri pasi pomuchengeti.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Nokudaro muna Khirisitu Jesu mese muri vana vaMwari, kuburikidza nokutenda, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />nokuti mese pakati penyu vadoombekewa muna Khirisitu mudosimira Khirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Hapachinai muJudha kana muGiriki, hapachinai muranda kana adosununguka, hapachinai munhurume kana munhukadzi. Ndava mese muri mubodzi muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Zvino kana muri vache Khirisitu, muri budzi raAbhurahamu, vaji vonhaka maererano nochivimbiso.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Zvandinoreva nzvokuti, muji wonhaka, paanenge achiri mwana, anenge asinai kusiyana nomuranda, kana nepo ari muridzi wozvinhu zvese. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Muji wonhaka ari pasi povareri novatariri kusvikira panguwa idotariwa nababa vache. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Nzvibodzi naisisu, patanga tiri vana, tanga tiri varanda vomweya yopanyika. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Asi nguwa paidodzonatsa kuzara, Mwari adotuma Mwanakomana wache, adozvahwa nomukadzi, nokudzorarama ari pasi pomutemo, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />kuti asunungure vaye vanga vari pasi pomutemo, kuti titambire kuitiwa kwedu vanakomana vaMwari.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Sezvo muri vana, Mwari adotuma Mweya woMwanakomana wache mumwoyo yedu, anodaidzira kuti, “Baba, Baba.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Saka hausisiri muranda asi mwana wache. Sezvo uri mwana wache, uri muji wonhaka yaMwari.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hanya yaPhauro novaGaratiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kare, pamanga musinati maziva Mwari, maiva varanda vozvinhu zvisiri Mwari. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Asi zvino zvamava kuziva Mwari, kana kuti, zvamava kuzikana naMwari, indava yei mavakudzokera kumitemo isingakodzere isinai nokabonyo kese? Munodirei pakamu kuva varanda vayene iyo isingakoshe? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Munochengeta mazuva, nomwedzi, nomwaka, nomakore! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ndinochira kuti basa randidokuitirai ndidobatira mahara.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Hama, ndinokukumbirai, ivai kunge inini, nokuti inini ndidova kunge imimi. Hapanai chamudonditadzira. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Sekuziva kwamunoita, kwaiva kuhwara kwandaiita kudoita kuti ndikuparidzirei vhangeri pakuthanga. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Kana nepo mamiriro yomuviri wangu wanga uri muedzo kwamuri, hamunai kundiramba kana kundizvidza. Asi mudonditambira kunge ngirozi yaMwari, kunge ndanga ndiri Khirisitu Jesu pachake. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Chii chidoitika pakugutsikana kwamainzva? Ndava ndinokupupurirai kuti, dai maigona kuzviita dai mudototokonora meso yenyu muchindipasa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ko zvino ndava muvengi wenyu chere nondava yokukunyepai chokwadi?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Vanhu vakarevo vanonangidza kuva nochido chikuru naimimi, asi havanai chinangwa chidonaka. Chavanondoda kukuparadzanisai nainini, kuti muite shungu navo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Zvidonaka kuita shungu, ndokunge dziri shungu dzozvidonaka, uye dzichigara dzidodaro, aikona pandinenge ndinemi basi. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Vana vangu vanodikana, ndinokudzimbiwa kwokuzvara kamu kusvikira Khirisitu waumbiwa mamuri. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ndinosuva kuva pabodzi naimimi izvozvi kuti ndisandure manyairiro yangu. Ndava ndiri kushushikana nokuda kwenyu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muenzaniso waHaga naSara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Ndinyepei, imipa munoda kuva pasi pomutemo, munonzvaba zvinorehwa nomutemo nai? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ndava kudonyohwa kuti Abhurahamu wanga ano vanakomana vairi, umwe womurandakadzi umwe womukadzi adosununguka. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Asi mwanakomana womuranda adozvariwa nonzira yonyama, mwanakomana womukadzi adosununguka adozvariwa zvichibva pachivimbiso. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Manje zvakarezvi husurudzira, vakadzi vairi vakareva zvibvumirano zviiri. Chimwe chinobva pagomo roSinai, ndiye mukadzi anozvara vana vouranda, ndiye Haga. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Zvino Haga anomirira Gomo roSinai riri muArabhiya, rinosuridzira guta roJerusarema razvino, riri pauranda novana varene vese. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Asi Jerusarema riri kumusoro ridosununguka, ndivo amai vedu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Ndava zvidonyohwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Fara iwe ngomwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Iwepa usinai kudzimbiwa pakuzvara!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ndava vana vaiye adosiiwa mbazinji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kukunda vaiye anomurume.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Zvino imimi, hama, kunge Isaki, muri vana vochivimbiso. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Asi sepanguwa iyoyo mwana adozvahwa nonzira yonyama adotambudza adozvariwa nosimba roMweya, ndizvo zvazviri zvino. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Asi gwaro rinoti chii? Rinoti, “Dzinga murandakadzi nomwanakomana wache, ndava mwanakomana womurandakadzi angajeba nhaka pabodzi nomwanakomana womukadzi adosununguka.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Saka, hama dzangu, hatisi vana vomurandakadzi asi vomukadzi adosununguka.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Chengetedzai Rusununguko Renyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Khirisitu adotisunungurira rugare, saka mirai mudojirichira, mureke kuzviisa kamu pauranda.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Manje inipano Phauro, ndinoti kwamuri kana mukatambira kuchecheudziwa, Khirisitu haachinai chiyamuro kwamuri. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Pakare ndinonyairira munhu wese anotambira kuchecheudziwa kuti anomanikidzihwa kuchengeta mutemo wese. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Iyemi munoda kururamisiwa nomutemo makwachuriwa kubva pana Khirisitu, mambwera kubva pamutsa. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ndava kuburikidza noMweya tinomirira nokutenda kururama kwatinotariro nako. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ndava muna Khirisitu Jesu kuchecheudziwa kana kusachecheudziwa, hazvinai nokabonyo kese, asi chinokosha kutenda kunoshanda kuburikidza norudo.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Maitizira zvidonaka! Mbani adokurambidzai kuteerera chokwadi? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kupenzveredzewa kudodaiku hakunai kubva kuna Mwari adokudaidzai. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Mbiriso ishomashoma inofufumisa mukanyiwa wese. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ndichinochokwadi muna Ishe kuti hamungatore yamwe maonero. Iye ari kukuvhiringidzai, zvisinei kuti mbani, achawana mutongo wache.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Hama, dai ndichiri kuparidza kuchecheudziwa, zvino ndinotambudzihwei? Dai zviri izvo chigumburo chomuchinjikwa chinenge chabisiwa peno. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ndinotoda kuti dai vanokunyonganisaivo vasvike pakutozvisunura!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Hama mudodaidzihwa rusununguko. Asi chete rekai kushandisa kusununguka kwenyu semukana wokufadza muviri. Asi kuburikidza norudo ivai vanoshandirana. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Nokuti mutemo wese unozazisiwa noshoko ribodzi rinoti, “Unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Asi kana muchirumana nokujana kunge mhuka, natsai kuti mureke kupedzana.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mweya noUnhu hwoKare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Asi ndinoti, fambai muMweya, kuti mureke kugutsa zvido zvonyama. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Ndava zvido zvonyama zvinopesana nozvido zvoMweya. Ndava zviiri zvakarezvi zvidotsvatsvana, kuti zvimbokutadzisai kuita zvamunoda. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Asi kana muchitungamirihwa noMweya hamusi pasi pomutemo.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Manje zviito zvounhu hwokare zviri pachenu zvinoti, upombwe, utsambwa, ubatabata, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kushopera, uroyi, kutsvatsvana, kudzongonyedza, chanje, ukari, umbimbindoga, kukamurana, zvikwata zvikwata, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />kunyangarihwa, kuraradza, undaradzi nomitambo idofumuka, nozvidofanana nozvakarezvi. Ndinokuchenjedzai, sezvandidomboita, kuti vanoita zvidodarozvo vanojaba nhaka youmambo hwaMwari.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Asi chibereko choMweya ndiro rudo, mufaro, runyararo, mwoyo murefu, tsitsi, kunaka, kutendeseka, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />kupfava nokuzvibata. Hapanai mutemo unopesana nokuita kudodai. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Futi avo vari vaKhirisitu Jesu vadoroverera unhu hwokare pabodzi nokuchiva kwayene nozvido zvayene. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Kana tichirarama tiri muMweya, mbatitongewewo noMweya. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Mbatirekei kumbozvikudza, kana kumbosorana kana kuitirana usvinu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Takuriranai Mutoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Hama, kana munhu akabatiwa achitadza, imipa vanorarama mumweya mudzoreredzei mudopfava. Asi chenjerai, kuti naimipawo mureke kuedzewa. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Takuriranai mitoro, ndiyo nzira yamunozazisa nayo mutemo waKhirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ndava kana munhu achifunga kuti iye chinhu, ipo pasinai zvaari, anozvinyengedza. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Asi umwe noumwe mbaatarisitse zviito zvache. Kana zvidonaka wava nochokudada nacho iye pachake, pasinai waanozvienzanisa naye. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ndava munhu wese anofanira kuzvitakurira mutoro wache.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Anodzidzisiwa shoko raMwari mbaakoverane zvinhu zvese zvidonaka nouyo anomudzidzisa.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Rekai kunyengedzewa, Mwari haasekewe, ndava chese chinojariwa nomunhu ndicho chaanokohwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Kana ukajara zvinofadza zvido zvounhu hwokare, anokohwa kuora kunobva paunhu hwokare, ukajara zvinofadza Mweya, anokohwa upenyu husingapere hunobva paMweya. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Mbatirekei kuneta pakuita zvidonaka, ndava nguwa yazvene ikakwana tichakohwa peno, kana tisingaore mwoyo. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Saka, pese patinowana mukana, mbatiitei zvidonaka kuvanhu vese, kunyanyitsa kumhuri yovanotenda.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo yoKupedzisira noKumoresana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Onai mukuriro womabhii yandiri kukunyorerai nojanja rangu chairo. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Vanhu vaye vokuda dzvene kuvanhu ndivo vanokusukumidzirai kuti muchecheudziwe. Izvozvo vanondozviitira kuti vanzvenge kutambudzihwa muchinjikwa waKhirisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ndava kana naivo vanoita zvokuchecheudziwa vacho vanochengetaba mutemo, asi vanoda kuti imipa mukachecheudziwa vazvirumbidze pamusoro pomuviri wenyu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Asi inini ndinondozvirumbidza nokuda kwomuchinjikwa waIshe Jesu Khirisitu basi, kuburikidza naiwo nyika idoroverehwa kwandiri, nainini ndidoroverehwa kunyika. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ndava kuchecheudziwa kana kusachecheudziwa hapanai zvakunoreva, asi kuva chisikwa chitsva. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Runyararo notsitsi mbazvive pamusoro wese anofamba nomurau wakareyu, munhu adodaroyo ndiye, muIzirairi waMwari.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Kubva zvino mbapareke kuva nomunhu anondiisa mumatambudziko, ndava zvidzvanga zvaJesu zviri pamuiri wangu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Hama, mutsa waIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive nomweya wenyu. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>